msgstr ""
"# Installation and Environment Configuration\n"
"\n"
"## 1. Overview\n"
"\n"
"This document describes how to install Triton-Ascend and configure the environment. Triton-Ascend is a Triton backend for Ascend NPUs, enabling developers to write high-performance operators using the Triton language and run them on Ascend hardware.\n"
"\n"
"## 2. Prerequisites\n"
"\n"
"Before installing Triton-Ascend, ensure the following conditions are met:\n"
"\n"
"- **Operating System**: Ubuntu 20.04 or later, or a compatible Linux distribution.\n"
"- **Python**: Python 3.8 or later.\n"
"- **PyTorch**: PyTorch 2.0 or later.\n"
"- **CANN**: CANN 6.0 or later.\n"
"- **Ascend NPU**: Atlas A2/A3/950 series or other supported Ascend hardware.\n"
"\n"
"## 3. Installation Steps\n"
"\n"
"### 3.1 Install CANN\n"
"\n"
"1. Download the CANN installation package from the [Ascend community](https://www.hiascend.com/).\n"
"2. Follow the CANN installation guide to install CANN.\n"
"3. After installation, set the environment variables:\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"source /usr/local/Ascend/ascend-toolkit/set_env.sh\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"### 3.2 Install PyTorch and TorchNPU\n"
"\n"
"1. Install PyTorch:\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"pip install torch\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"2. Install TorchNPU:\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"pip install torch-npu\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"### 3.3 Install Triton-Ascend\n"
"\n"
"1. Clone the Triton-Ascend repository:\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"git clone https://github.com/Ascend/Triton-Ascend.git\n"
"cd Triton-Ascend\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"2. Install dependencies:\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"pip install -r requirements.txt\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"3. Build and install Triton-Ascend:\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"python setup.py install\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## 4. Environment Configuration\n"
"\n"
"### 4.1 Set Environment Variables\n"
"\n"
"Add the following environment variables to your shell profile (e.g., `~/.bashrc`):\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"export ASCEND_HOME=/usr/local/Ascend/ascend-toolkit\n"
"export PATH=$ASCEND_HOME/bin:$PATH\n"
"export LD_LIBRARY_PATH=$ASCEND_HOME/lib64:$LD_LIBRARY_PATH\n"
"export PYTHONPATH=$ASCEND_HOME/python/site-packages:$PYTHONPATH\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"### 4.2 Verify Installation\n"
"\n"
"Run the following command to verify the installation:\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"python -c \"import triton_ascend; print(triton_ascend.__version__)\"\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"If the version number is printed, the installation is successful.\n"
"\n"
"## 5. Troubleshooting\n"
"\n"
"### 5.1 Compilation Errors\n"
"\n"
"If you encounter compilation errors, check the following:\n"
"\n"
"- Ensure that CANN and PyTorch are installed correctly.\n"
"- Ensure that the environment variables are set correctly.\n"
"- Check the log output for detailed error information.\n"
"\n"
"### 5.2 Runtime Errors\n"
"\n"
"If you encounter runtime errors, check the following:\n"
"\n"
"- Ensure that the Ascend NPU is properly connected and recognized.\n"
"- Ensure that the operator is compatible with the Ascend NPU architecture.\n"
"- Use the `TRITON_DEBUG` environment variable to enable detailed log output:\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"export TRITON_DEBUG=1\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## 6. Uninstallation\n"
"\n"
"To uninstall Triton-Ascend, run the following command:\n"
"\n"
"```bash\n"
"pip uninstall triton-ascend\n"
"```\n"
"\n"
"## 7. Additional Resources\n"
"\n"
"- [Triton-Ascend GitHub Repository](https://github.com/Ascend/Triton-Ascend)\n"
"- [Ascend Community](https://www.hiascend.com/)\n"
"- [CANN Documentation](https://www.hiascend.com/document)\n"

msgid "安装指南"
msgstr "Installation Guide"

msgid "**Triton-Ascend**是适配华为Ascend处理器的Triton优化版本，主要用于提供高效的核函数自动调优、算子编译及部署能力，支持Ascend Atlas A2/A3/950系列产品，兼容Triton核心语法的同时，针对昇腾NPU特性进行了深度优化，包括自动解析核函数参数、优化内存访问逻辑、完善安全部署机制等。帮助用户在昇腾平台上快速开发和部署高性能计算任务。"
msgstr "**Triton-Ascend** is an optimized version of Triton adapted for Huawei Ascend processors. It is primarily designed to provide efficient kernel autotuning, operator compilation, and deployment capabilities. It supports Ascend Atlas A2/A3/950 series products and is compatible with core Triton syntax while being deeply optimized for Ascend NPU features, including automatic parsing of kernel parameters, optimization of memory access logic, and enhancement of secure deployment mechanisms. It helps users rapidly develop and deploy high-performance computing tasks on the Ascend platform."

